<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"><title>TaskFlow | Task Manager</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css"></head>
<body><div class="app-shell">
<aside class="sidebar"><a class="brand" href="/"><span class="brand-mark">✓</span><span>TaskFlow</span></a><div class="side-label">WORKSPACE</div><a class="nav-link active" href="/"><span>▦</span> All tasks</a>
<div class="side-note"><div class="note-icon">✦</div><strong>Small steps, big progress.</strong><p>Keep your day organized and focus on what matters.</p></div><div class="sidebar-bottom"><span class="online-dot"></span> Your personal workspace</div></aside>
<main class="main-content"><header class="topbar"><div><div class="eyebrow">YOUR WORKSPACE</div><h1>Task overview</h1></div><button class="primary-btn" id="openTaskForm"><span>＋</span> New task</button></header>
<% if (error) { %><div class="alert"><%= error %></div><% } %>
<section class="welcome-row"><div><h2>Make today count <span>✦</span></h2><p>Plan it. Do it. Check it off.</p></div><div class="date-chip" id="todayLabel"></div></section>
<section class="stats-grid">
<article class="stat-card"><div class="stat-top"><span class="stat-icon total">▦</span><span class="stat-caption">ALL TASKS</span></div><div class="stat-number"><%= counts.total %></div><div class="stat-foot">Tasks in your workspace</div></article>
<article class="stat-card"><div class="stat-top"><span class="stat-icon pending">◷</span><span class="stat-caption">PENDING</span></div><div class="stat-number"><%= counts.pending %></div><div class="stat-foot">Waiting to get started</div></article>
<article class="stat-card"><div class="stat-top"><span class="stat-icon progress">↗</span><span class="stat-caption">IN PROGRESS</span></div><div class="stat-number"><%= counts.progress %></div><div class="stat-foot">Work in motion</div></article>
<article class="stat-card"><div class="stat-top"><span class="stat-icon completed">✓</span><span class="stat-caption">COMPLETED</span></div><div class="stat-number"><%= counts.completed %></div><div class="stat-foot">Great work so far</div></article></section>
<section class="tasks-section"><div class="section-heading"><div><h2>Your tasks</h2><p>Manage your tasks and track your progress.</p></div></div>
<form class="filters" action="/" method="GET"><label class="search-box"><span>⌕</span><input type="search" name="search" value="<%= search %>" placeholder="Search tasks..."></label>
<select name="status" aria-label="Filter by status"><option value="">All statuses</option><option value="Pending" <%= selectedStatus === "Pending" ? "selected" : "" %>>Pending</option><option value="In Progress" <%= selectedStatus === "In Progress" ? "selected" : "" %>>In Progress</option><option value="Completed" <%= selectedStatus === "Completed" ? "selected" : "" %>>Completed</option></select><button class="filter-btn" type="submit">Filter</button><% if (search || selectedStatus) { %><a class="clear-filter" href="/">Clear</a><% } %></form>
<% if (tasks.length === 0) { %><div class="empty-state"><div class="empty-icon">✓</div><h3>No tasks found</h3><p>Create a new task or adjust your search filters.</p><button class="primary-btn" id="emptyAddTask" type="button">＋ Add your first task</button></div>
<% } else { %><div class="task-list"><% tasks.forEach(task => { %><article class="task-card <%= task.status === 'Completed' ? 'is-completed' : '' %>">
<div class="task-check-wrap"><form action="/tasks/<%= task._id %>/status" method="POST"><input type="hidden" name="status" value="<%= task.status === 'Completed' ? 'Pending' : 'Completed' %>"><button class="check-circle <%= task.status === 'Completed' ? 'checked' : '' %>" type="submit" aria-label="Toggle completion"><%= task.status === 'Completed' ? '✓' : '' %></button></form></div>
<div class="task-info"><h3><%= task.title %></h3><% if (task.description) { %><p><%= task.description %></p><% } %><div class="task-meta"><span class="priority priority-<%= task.priority.toLowerCase() %>"><span>●</span> <%= task.priority %> priority</span><% if (task.dueDate) { %><span class="due-date">▣ Due <%= formatDate(task.dueDate) %></span><% } %></div></div>
<div class="task-actions"><span class="status status-<%= task.status.toLowerCase().replace(' ', '-') %>"><%= task.status %></span>
<button class="icon-btn edit-btn" type="button" data-id="<%= task._id %>" data-title="<%= task.title %>" data-description="<%= task.description %>" data-priority="<%= task.priority %>" data-status="<%= task.status %>" data-due="<%= formatDate(task.dueDate) %>" aria-label="Edit task">✎</button>
<form action="/tasks/<%= task._id %>/delete" method="POST" onsubmit="return confirm('Delete this task?')"><button class="icon-btn delete-btn" type="submit" aria-label="Delete task">⌫</button></form></div></article><% }) %></div><% } %>
<div class="list-footer">Showing <strong><%= tasks.length %></strong> task<%= tasks.length === 1 ? '' : 's' %></div></section><footer>Made for focused days <span>♥</span></footer></main></div>
<div class="modal-backdrop" id="taskModal" aria-hidden="true"><section class="modal" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="modalTitle"><div class="modal-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">TASK DETAILS</div><h2 id="modalTitle">Create a new task</h2></div><button class="close-btn" id="closeModal" type="button" aria-label="Close">×</button></div>
<form id="taskForm" action="/tasks" method="POST"><label class="field-label">Task title <span>*</span><input type="text" name="title" id="taskTitle" maxlength="120" placeholder="e.g. Finish project report" required></label>
<label class="field-label">Description <textarea name="description" id="taskDescription" rows="3" maxlength="1000" placeholder="Add a few details (optional)"></textarea></label>
<div class="form-row"><label class="field-label">Priority<select name="priority" id="taskPriority"><option>Low</option><option selected>Medium</option><option>High</option></select></label><label class="field-label">Due date<input type="date" name="dueDate" id="taskDueDate"></label></div>
<label class="field-label" id="statusField" hidden>Status<select name="status" id="taskStatus"><option>Pending</option><option>In Progress</option><option>Completed</option></select></label>
<div class="modal-actions"><button class="cancel-btn" id="cancelModal" type="button">Cancel</button><button class="primary-btn" type="submit" id="saveTaskBtn">Create task <span>→</span></button></div></form></section></div>
<script src="/js/main.js"></script></body></html>